==Icelandic==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|is|aldregi}} (''archaic or poetic'')

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈaltreiː/|lang=is}}

===Adverb===
{{head|is|adverb}}

# [[never]], at no [[time]]
#: ''Ég mun '''aldrei''' fyrirgefa þér.''
#:: I will '''never''' forgive you.
#: ''Hún sagðist ætla að koma klukkan 8 en hún kemur '''aldrei''' á réttum tíma.''
#:: She said she'd show up at 8 but she's '''never''' on time.

====Derived terms====
* [[aldrei framar]] (never again)

